  "title": "Measurement Uncertainty: GUM LPU, Monte Carlo & UEC-0..3",
  "subtitle": "How input distributions combine, when linear propagation (GUM LPU) breaks down on boxcar or nonlinear geometric measurands, and why UEC-0 never fabricates a number.",
  "phase": "P1a",
  "status": "live-kernel",
  "provisional": false,
